{
    "type": "SettingsPanel", "name": "YteValueAddedPanel",
    "fields": {
        "priority": 9003,
        "rect": "$OptionsPanelRect",
        "anchor": { "x": 0.5 },
    },
    "children": [
        {
            "type": "ImageWidget", "name": "ScrollBarBackground",
            "fields": {
                "rect": "$OptionsScrollBarBackgroundRect",
                "anchor": { "x": 1.0 },
                "filename": "PauseMenu\\VerticalScroll",
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "ScrollControllerWidget", "name": "ScrollController",
                    "fields": {
                        "rect": "$OptionsScrollBarRect",
                        "anchor": { "x": 1.0 },
                        "upArrowFilepath": "FrontEnd\\HD\\Final\\FrontEnd_ScrollUpBtn",
                        "downArrowFilepath": "FrontEnd\\HD\\Final\\FrontEnd_ScrollDownBtn",
                        "barFilepath": "PauseMenu\\VerticalIndicator",
                        "viewName": "ScrollView",
                        "wheelScrollSound": "cursor_scroll_hd",
                        "buttonScrollSound": "cursor_scroll_hd",
                    }
                },
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "ScrollViewWidget", "name": "ScrollView",
            "fields": {
                "fitToParent": true,
                "scrollControllerName": "ScrollController",
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "TextBoxWidget", "name": "YteVA01",
                    "fields": {
                        "rect": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "width": 1800, "height": 100 },
                        "style": {
                            "fontColor": "$FontColorOrange",
                            "alignment": { "h": "left", "v": "center" },
                            "options": { "lineWrap": true, "pipeCharacterBehavior": "handle", "newlineHandling": "standard" },
                            "pointSize": "$MediumLargeFontSize",
                            "spacing": "$DefaultSpacing",
                        },
                        "text": "欢迎使用 YteMod ，祝您游戏愉快！", 
                    },
					"children": [
						{
							"type": "ImageWidget", "name": "Divider",
							"fields": {
								"rect": "$OptionsDividerRect",
								"filename": "PauseMenu\\Divider",
							}
						},
					]
                },
                {
                    "type": "TextBoxWidget", "name": "YteVA02",
                    "fields": {
                        "rect": { "x": 0, "y": 110, "width": 1800, "height": 60 },
                        "style": {
                            "fontColor": "$FontColorGoldYellow",
                            "alignment": { "h": "left", "v": "center" },
                            "options": { "lineWrap": true, "pipeCharacterBehavior": "handle", "newlineHandling": "standard" },
                            "pointSize": "$MediumFontSize",
                            "spacing": "$DefaultSpacing",
                        },
                        "text": "从 3.0 版本开始推出共享版和增值版两种版本，增值版为付费版本，享受额外的增值内容。", 
                    }
                },
                {
                    "type": "TextBoxWidget", "name": "YteVA03",
                    "fields": {
                        "rect": { "x": 0, "y": 170, "width": 1800, "height": 60 },
                        "style": {
                            "fontColor": "$FontColorGoldYellow",
                            "alignment": { "h": "left", "v": "center" },
                            "options": { "lineWrap": true, "pipeCharacterBehavior": "handle", "newlineHandling": "standard" },
                            "pointSize": "$MediumFontSize",
                            "spacing": "$DefaultSpacing",
                        },
                        "text": "增值功能项目为买断制，一次付费享受该增值功能的后续所有更新维护服务。", 
                    }
                },
                {
                    "type": "TextBoxWidget", "name": "YteVA04",
                    "fields": {
                        "rect": { "x": 0, "y": 230, "width": 1800, "height": 60 },
                        "style": {
                            "fontColor": "$FontColorGoldYellow",
                            "alignment": { "h": "left", "v": "center" },
                            "options": { "lineWrap": true, "pipeCharacterBehavior": "handle", "newlineHandling": "standard" },
                            "pointSize": "$MediumFontSize",
                            "spacing": "$DefaultSpacing",
                        },
                        "text": "后续若开发出新的增值功能则以增值包的形式推出，可按需求选择是否购买。", 
                    }
                },
                {
                    "type": "TextBoxWidget", "name": "YteVA05",
                    "fields": {
                        "rect": { "x": 0, "y": 290, "width": 1800, "height": 60 },
                        "style": {
                            "fontColor": "$FontColorGoldYellow",
                            "alignment": { "h": "left", "v": "center" },
                            "options": { "lineWrap": true, "pipeCharacterBehavior": "handle", "newlineHandling": "standard" },
                            "pointSize": "$MediumFontSize",
                            "spacing": "$DefaultSpacing",
                        },
                        "text": "共享版和增值版的主要区别为：内置的查询功能@ytecyc8「凯恩之书」@ytecyc4资料及UI界面布局等功能的差异。", 
                    }
                },
                {
                    "type": "TextBoxWidget", "name": "YteVA06",
                    "fields": {
                        "rect": { "x": 0, "y": 350, "width": 1800, "height": 60 },
                        "style": {
                            "fontColor": "$FontColorGoldYellow",
                            "alignment": { "h": "left", "v": "center" },
                            "options": { "lineWrap": true, "pipeCharacterBehavior": "handle", "newlineHandling": "standard" },
                            "pointSize": "$MediumFontSize",
                            "spacing": "$DefaultSpacing",
                        },
                        "text": "共享版提供完整的方块公式、符文之语资料及部分其他项目资料。", 
                    }
                },
                {
                    "type": "TextBoxWidget", "name": "YteVA07",
                    "fields": {
                        "rect": { "x": 0, "y": 410, "width": 1800, "height": 60 },
                        "style": {
                            "fontColor": "$FontColorGoldYellow",
                            "alignment": { "h": "left", "v": "center" },
                            "options": { "lineWrap": true, "pipeCharacterBehavior": "handle", "newlineHandling": "standard" },
                            "pointSize": "$MediumFontSize",
                            "spacing": "$DefaultSpacing",
                        },
                        "text": "增值版提供完整的方块公式、符文之语、暗金、套装、实用基础物品、基础知识、有价值物品最高词缀", 
                    }
                },
                {
                    "type": "TextBoxWidget", "name": "YteVA08",
                    "fields": {
                        "rect": { "x": 0, "y": 470, "width": 1800, "height": 60 },
                        "style": {
                            "fontColor": "$FontColorGoldYellow",
                            "alignment": { "h": "left", "v": "center" },
                            "options": { "lineWrap": true, "pipeCharacterBehavior": "handle", "newlineHandling": "standard" },
                            "pointSize": "$MediumFontSize",
                            "spacing": "$DefaultSpacing",
                        },
                        "text": "属性等资料，以及更多UI界面布局方案和其他功能优化。", 
                    }
                },
                {
                    "type": "TextBoxWidget", "name": "YteVA09",
                    "fields": {
                        "rect": { "x": 0, "y": 530, "width": 1800, "height": 60 },
                        "style": {
                            "fontColor": "$FontColorGoldYellow",
                            "alignment": { "h": "left", "v": "center" },
                            "options": { "lineWrap": true, "pipeCharacterBehavior": "handle", "newlineHandling": "standard" },
                            "pointSize": "$MediumFontSize",
                            "spacing": "$DefaultSpacing",
                        },
                        "text": "共享版与增值版差异其实不大，核心、重要功能共享版都有。增值版多出的内容也就是一些基础资料，", 
                    }
                },
                {
                    "type": "TextBoxWidget", "name": "YteVA10",
                    "fields": {
                        "rect": { "x": 0, "y": 590, "width": 1800, "height": 60 },
                        "style": {
                            "fontColor": "$FontColorGoldYellow",
                            "alignment": { "h": "left", "v": "center" },
                            "options": { "lineWrap": true, "pipeCharacterBehavior": "handle", "newlineHandling": "standard" },
                            "pointSize": "$MediumFontSize",
                            "spacing": "$DefaultSpacing",
                        },
                        "text": "在网站、小程序里都能轻易查询到，内置到游戏内也仅是增加一点便利而已。将其作为付费项目也不是", 
                    }
                },
                {
                    "type": "TextBoxWidget", "name": "YteVA11",
                    "fields": {
                        "rect": { "x": 0, "y": 650, "width": 1800, "height": 60 },
                        "style": {
                            "fontColor": "$FontColorGoldYellow",
                            "alignment": { "h": "left", "v": "center" },
                            "options": { "lineWrap": true, "pipeCharacterBehavior": "handle", "newlineHandling": "standard" },
                            "pointSize": "$MediumFontSize",
                            "spacing": "$DefaultSpacing",
                        },
                        "text": "因为这点便利有这个价值，只是为了区分免费与付费而已。以这种方式收费究其原因，一是做此 MOD ", 
                    }
                },
                {
                    "type": "TextBoxWidget", "name": "YteVA12",
                    "fields": {
                        "rect": { "x": 0, "y": 710, "width": 1800, "height": 60 },
                        "style": {
                            "fontColor": "$FontColorGoldYellow",
                            "alignment": { "h": "left", "v": "center" },
                            "options": { "lineWrap": true, "pipeCharacterBehavior": "handle", "newlineHandling": "standard" },
                            "pointSize": "$MediumFontSize",
                            "spacing": "$DefaultSpacing",
                        },
                        "text": "确实耗费了大量时间，二是现实问题，希望能以此获得一点收入，所以，还请有能力的朋友可以多多支", 
                    }
                },
                {
                    "type": "TextBoxWidget", "name": "YteVA13",
                    "fields": {
                        "rect": { "x": 0, "y": 770, "width": 1800, "height": 60 },
                        "style": {
                            "fontColor": "$FontColorGoldYellow",
                            "alignment": { "h": "left", "v": "center" },
                            "options": { "lineWrap": true, "pipeCharacterBehavior": "handle", "newlineHandling": "standard" },
                            "pointSize": "$MediumFontSize",
                            "spacing": "$DefaultSpacing",
                        },
                        "text": "持一下，谢谢！", 
                    }
                },
                {
                    "type": "TextBoxWidget", "name": "YteVA14",
                    "fields": {
                        "rect": { "x": 0, "y": 830, "width": 1800, "height": 60 },
                        "style": {
                            "fontColor": "$FontColorGoldYellow",
                            "alignment": { "h": "left", "v": "center" },
                            "options": { "lineWrap": true, "pipeCharacterBehavior": "handle", "newlineHandling": "standard" },
                            "pointSize": "$MediumFontSize",
                            "spacing": "$DefaultSpacing",
                        },
                        "text": "使用过程中如有问题或发现错漏之处也欢迎在论坛或QQ群里反馈。", 
                    }
                },
                {
                    "type": "TextBoxWidget", "name": "YteVA15",
                    "fields": {
                        "rect": { "x": 0, "y": 890, "width": 1800, "height": 60 },
                        "style": {
                            "fontColor": "$FontColorOrange",
                            "alignment": { "h": "left", "v": "center" },
                            "options": { "lineWrap": true, "pipeCharacterBehavior": "handle", "newlineHandling": "standard" },
                            "pointSize": "$MediumFontSize",
                            "spacing": "$DefaultSpacing",
                        },
                        "text": "升级增值版方法：@ytecyc2（当前为共享版可升级）", 
                    }
                },
                {
                    "type": "TextBoxWidget", "name": "YteVA16",
                    "fields": {
                        "rect": { "x": 0, "y": 950, "width": 1800, "height": 60 },
                        "style": {
                            "fontColor": "$FontColorGoldYellow",
                            "alignment": { "h": "left", "v": "center" },
                            "options": { "lineWrap": true, "pipeCharacterBehavior": "handle", "newlineHandling": "standard" },
                            "pointSize": "$MediumFontSize",
                            "spacing": "$DefaultSpacing",
                        },
                        "text": "微信/支付宝扫码赞助，30元/半年、50元/1年、100元/3年，留言附上邮箱用以接收获取信息。", 
                    },
					"children": [
						{
							"type": "ImageWidget", "name": "YteDSM",
							"fields": {
								"rect": { "x": 0, "y": 70 },
								"filename": "ytepic/dgs",
							}
						},
						{
							"type": "ImageWidget", "name": "YteDSM",
							"fields": {
								"rect": { "x": 300, "y": 70 },
								"filename": "ytepic/dgs_zfb",
							}
						},
					]
                },
                {
                    "type": "TextBoxWidget", "name": "YteVA17",
                    "fields": {
                        "rect": { "x": 260, "y": 1010, "width": 1800, "height": 60 },
                        "style": {
                            "fontColor": "$FontColorOrange",
                            "alignment": { "h": "left", "v": "center" },
                            "options": { "lineWrap": true, "pipeCharacterBehavior": "handle", "newlineHandling": "standard" },
                            "pointSize": "$MediumFontSize",
                            "spacing": "$DefaultSpacing",
                        },
                        "text": "", 
                    }
                },
                {
                    "type": "ButtonWidget", "name": "Close",
                    "fields": {
                        "rect": { "x": 600, "y": 1150 },
                        "filename": "Panel\\Modals\\ModalButton",
                        "focusIndicatorFilename": "Controller/HoverImages/ModalButton_NoGap_Hover",
                        "hoveredFrame": 3,
                        "onClickMessage": "PanelManager:ClosePanel:YtemodInfo",
                        "textColor": "$LightButtonTextColor",
                        "text/style" : "$StyleFEMultiLineButtonText",
                        "textString": "@close", 
                    }
                },
            ]
        },
    ]
}
